  "description": "SUTROQ crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H138 Ce6 N6 O32,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce5 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce6 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.732-3.818 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.66-119.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Ce6O4(OH)4(O2CtBu)12(L1)2·CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
